1
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:09,320
(The Underworld)

2
00:00:09,920 --> 00:00:12,080
(Shen Yanlin)

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,940
♪Cruel world, where trust runs thin♪
(Ling Che)

4
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:22,320
♪Blades clash. Who will rise above?♪
(Shuangdao Hui)

5
00:00:22,840 --> 00:00:28,040
♪Behind every smile, danger waits♪
(Dongshan Tai)

6
00:00:28,040 --> 00:00:30,520
(Fei Liu)

7
00:00:31,480 --> 00:00:35,080
♪Know your limits, know your worth♪
(Luo Song)

8
00:00:36,080 --> 00:00:39,800
♪Stand strong against the raging tide♪
(Annie)

9
00:00:40,520 --> 00:00:44,120
♪Ask how many times I've lost my way♪

10
00:00:44,720 --> 00:00:49,000
♪Storms rage on the road to power♪

11
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:52,960
♪Let old promises fade into memory♪

12
00:00:52,960 --> 00:00:58,040
♪Alone and fearless, I won't back down♪

13
00:00:58,040 --> 00:01:02,120
♪Power is a crown forged in blood♪

14
00:01:02,120 --> 00:01:09,040
♪Brotherhood is shelter from the storm♪

15
00:01:12,200 --> 00:01:15,680
=The Underworld=

16
00:01:15,680 --> 00:01:18,680
(1995)

17
00:01:18,680 --> 00:01:19,319
Keep an eye out for me.

18
00:01:38,159 --> 00:01:38,920
I saw them. Over there.

19
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:39,439
Find them!

20
00:01:42,120 --> 00:01:42,439
Boss Che.

21
00:01:42,959 --> 00:01:43,359
Same as always.

22
00:01:43,599 --> 00:01:44,480
You cover me. I'll make the run.

23
00:01:44,760 --> 00:01:45,159
You go in.

24
00:01:45,640 --> 00:01:46,079
What?

25
00:01:49,799 --> 00:01:51,400
You steal back the cars you sold,

26
00:01:51,480 --> 00:01:52,400
modify them, and sell them again.

27
00:01:52,840 --> 00:01:54,280
You figured I'd never report

28
00:01:54,280 --> 00:01:55,280
because I bought a smuggled car, right?

29
00:01:56,959 --> 00:01:57,719
You wanted to catch me,

30
00:01:57,719 --> 00:01:59,400
so you bought a car from me on purpose?

31
00:01:59,519 --> 00:02:00,239
So what?

32
00:02:00,959 --> 00:02:01,359
Nothing.

33
00:02:01,840 --> 00:02:02,400
Making money...

34
00:02:03,159 --> 00:02:03,760
Are you happy?

35
00:02:04,159 --> 00:02:05,640
Get him! Cut him down!

36
00:02:09,719 --> 00:02:10,120
Get him!

37
00:02:10,919 --> 00:02:11,319
Get him!

38
00:02:13,840 --> 00:02:16,400
Stop! Don't run!

39
00:02:20,719 --> 00:02:22,199
Don't let him get away!

40
00:02:27,680 --> 00:02:28,639
Let's see where you run now.

41
00:02:30,240 --> 00:02:30,840
Guys!

42
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:31,800
Take him out!

43
00:03:05,566 --> 00:03:06,986
Crap!

44
00:03:23,681 --> 00:03:27,422
♪Another drink, another road
through the storm♪

45
00:03:28,762 --> 00:03:33,770
♪Old streetlights shine on heroes
in their twilight♪

46
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:35,560
Boss Che.

47
00:03:36,680 --> 00:03:37,120
Boss Che.

48
00:03:37,120 --> 00:03:38,639
- Hurry up! What are you doing?
- Boss Che.

49
00:03:39,639 --> 00:03:40,800
Boss Che.

50
00:03:41,280 --> 00:03:42,240
You can't even make it a few steps?

51
00:03:54,400 --> 00:03:54,960
Idiot.

52
00:03:56,479 --> 00:03:57,120
I'll carry you.

53
00:03:57,400 --> 00:03:58,319
Go. Leave me.

54
00:03:59,560 --> 00:04:00,560
Stop talking. Move.

55
00:04:02,960 --> 00:04:04,080
This is strange.

56
00:04:07,280 --> 00:04:07,879
Hang in there.

57
00:04:09,800 --> 00:04:10,319
Boss Che.

58
00:04:12,400 --> 00:04:13,199
Tell me...

59
00:04:13,919 --> 00:04:14,960
am I smart or what?

60
00:04:16,639 --> 00:04:17,839
When it mattered most,

61
00:04:19,120 --> 00:04:19,759
I...

62
00:04:20,079 --> 00:04:20,720
I...

63
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:22,360
Lin.

64
00:04:23,680 --> 00:04:24,040
Lin.

65
00:04:24,790 --> 00:04:28,126
=Episode 7=

66
00:04:28,126 --> 00:04:30,130
(1999)

67
00:04:30,759 --> 00:04:31,399
Hutou Jun

68
00:04:32,399 --> 00:04:33,920
kidnapped Boss Hai and hijacked
our shipment.

69
00:04:34,879 --> 00:04:35,639
What do you want?

70
00:04:36,920 --> 00:04:38,160
Now that we've caught the mole,

71
00:04:38,959 --> 00:04:40,120
shouldn't we grab him?

72
00:04:43,199 --> 00:04:45,360
Hutou Jun has plenty of men.

73
00:04:46,160 --> 00:04:47,199
If we go after him,

74
00:04:48,360 --> 00:04:49,800
I'm worried you'll get swallowed alive.

75
00:04:53,240 --> 00:04:54,560
We don't need that many people.

76
00:04:55,800 --> 00:04:56,720
The two of us are enough.

77
00:04:58,399 --> 00:04:59,319
Hutou Jun

78
00:05:00,079 --> 00:05:00,920
is very superstitious.

79
00:05:02,600 --> 00:05:03,680
For his casino opening,

80
00:05:04,240 --> 00:05:06,120
he'll definitely hold a ritual
to attract wealth.

81
00:05:18,324 --> 00:05:23,146
(Tigers Bring Fortune)

82
00:05:26,160 --> 00:05:26,800
He is here.

83
00:05:37,600 --> 00:05:37,879
This...

84
00:05:38,759 --> 00:05:40,160
This is the master you hired?

85
00:05:40,519 --> 00:05:41,040
Boss,

86
00:05:41,279 --> 00:05:43,319
this is the famous reincarnated child
from Southeast Asia.

87
00:05:47,000 --> 00:05:47,399
Does it work?

88
00:05:47,839 --> 00:05:48,319
Of course it does.

89
00:05:55,720 --> 00:05:56,160
What...

90
00:05:56,439 --> 00:05:56,879
does that mean?

91
00:06:00,959 --> 00:06:01,240
Master.

92
00:06:15,600 --> 00:06:16,040
What's he doing?

93
00:06:17,399 --> 00:06:18,160
He's channeling his power.

94
00:06:25,240 --> 00:06:29,000
(Tigers Bring Fortune)

95
00:06:59,480 --> 00:07:00,800
May the gods bless me.

96
00:07:01,120 --> 00:07:02,160
I, Hutou Jun,

97
00:07:02,759 --> 00:07:04,000
wish for endless wealth

98
00:07:04,519 --> 00:07:05,759
and unstoppable success.

99
00:07:07,399 --> 00:07:08,120
Kneel.

100
00:07:40,360 --> 00:07:41,360
The ritual is going on inside.

101
00:07:49,160 --> 00:07:49,879
Okay.

102
00:07:51,600 --> 00:07:52,600
Fu, don't look.

103
00:08:15,360 --> 00:08:16,360
You dare kidnap me?

104
00:08:17,120 --> 00:08:18,600
Do you know who I am?

105
00:08:18,959 --> 00:08:20,720
Then do you know who I am?

106
00:08:21,879 --> 00:08:22,680
Boss Hai's death

107
00:08:22,680 --> 00:08:23,519
is connected to you.

108
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:25,000
Was it your idea,

109
00:08:25,759 --> 00:08:26,879
or did someone put you up to it?

110
00:08:29,600 --> 00:08:30,360
You don't want to talk?

111
00:08:39,240 --> 00:08:40,039
Don't you dare!

112
00:08:47,519 --> 00:08:48,279
Ready to talk?

113
00:08:50,399 --> 00:08:51,039
That feels good.

114
00:08:52,120 --> 00:08:53,200
You're insane.

115
00:08:54,000 --> 00:08:54,519
Again!

116
00:08:56,600 --> 00:08:58,039
I'm hungry.

117
00:08:58,600 --> 00:08:59,720
Can't remember.

118
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:02,120
Hungry, huh?

119
00:09:06,080 --> 00:09:07,879
Here. Eat!

120
00:09:13,080 --> 00:09:14,039
Kill me if you want.

121
00:09:14,240 --> 00:09:15,879
You won't find out a thing.

122
00:09:19,240 --> 00:09:19,960
Go ahead!

123
00:09:20,759 --> 00:09:21,720
What are you waiting for?

124
00:09:22,200 --> 00:09:23,399
Go buy me food.

125
00:09:24,200 --> 00:09:26,279
I want roast goose from Wing Sang Kee.

126
00:09:26,559 --> 00:09:27,440
And...

127
00:09:27,919 --> 00:09:29,480
char siu buns from Cho Kee.

128
00:09:32,000 --> 00:09:33,080
You've got more guts than Duan.

129
00:09:33,960 --> 00:09:34,399
What?

130
00:09:35,279 --> 00:09:36,519
You came here just to order food?

131
00:09:36,679 --> 00:09:37,720
Once I'm full,

132
00:09:38,679 --> 00:09:40,399
maybe I'll remember something.

133
00:10:02,080 --> 00:10:02,799
You ate.

134
00:10:03,080 --> 00:10:03,840
Remember anything yet?

135
00:10:07,559 --> 00:10:08,360
(Dongcheng Tiger)
Talk!

136
00:10:08,960 --> 00:10:10,120
This roast goose

137
00:10:11,320 --> 00:10:12,080
is too salty.

138
00:10:15,559 --> 00:10:16,000
Lin.

139
00:10:18,759 --> 00:10:19,799
Take him to the back room.

140
00:10:20,840 --> 00:10:21,200
Move.

141
00:10:25,639 --> 00:10:27,000
Hutou Jun won't say anything.

142
00:10:27,000 --> 00:10:28,159
Why don't we just kill him?

143
00:10:28,600 --> 00:10:30,080
You're making things difficult
for Boss Hui.

144
00:10:30,759 --> 00:10:32,240
At least we need to give
the elders an explanation.

145
00:10:34,440 --> 00:10:38,480
(Dongcheng Tiger)

146
00:10:38,480 --> 00:10:39,279
By the way,

147
00:10:40,120 --> 00:10:40,879
about Zhong,

148
00:10:41,440 --> 00:10:42,320
Boss Hui asked me to...

149
00:10:46,159 --> 00:10:46,759
I'll handle it.

150
00:10:47,799 --> 00:10:48,440
Are you sure?

151
00:10:52,120 --> 00:10:52,799
(Dongcheng Tiger)
Alright, alright.

152
00:10:53,200 --> 00:10:53,679
You handle it.

153
00:10:55,279 --> 00:10:55,639
Have a drink.

154
00:11:03,559 --> 00:11:04,120
Boss Che.

155
00:11:04,480 --> 00:11:05,399
Please spare me.

156
00:11:05,960 --> 00:11:06,679
Give me a chance.

157
00:11:07,039 --> 00:11:07,679
You know...

158
00:11:07,799 --> 00:11:08,500
I've been with Boss Hui

159
00:11:08,500 --> 00:11:09,759
for a long time.

160
00:11:10,159 --> 00:11:11,320
Please let me go.

161
00:11:11,480 --> 00:11:12,600
If Hutou Jun finds out,

162
00:11:12,600 --> 00:11:14,080
he'll never let me live.

163
00:11:14,759 --> 00:11:15,240
Boss Che.

164
00:11:15,559 --> 00:11:16,759
Boss Che, give me a chance!

165
00:11:17,840 --> 00:11:19,639
Boss Che, don't kill me!

166
00:11:19,840 --> 00:11:21,120
Boss Che, please don't kill me!

167
00:11:21,320 --> 00:11:22,399
Give me one more chance.

168
00:11:23,240 --> 00:11:23,720
No...

169
00:11:23,840 --> 00:11:24,559
No...

170
00:11:25,000 --> 00:11:25,399
Boss Che!

171
00:11:25,960 --> 00:11:27,480
Please! Don't!

172
00:11:33,159 --> 00:11:36,080
Thank you, Boss Che. Thank you.

173
00:11:37,080 --> 00:11:38,120
Hide for now.

174
00:11:38,799 --> 00:11:39,960
The boat arrives at the pier
at midnight.

175
00:11:41,240 --> 00:11:42,679
Tell them Zhao sent you.

176
00:11:43,559 --> 00:11:46,240
I understand. I understand.

177
00:11:46,600 --> 00:11:47,399
Start a new life.

178
00:11:48,799 --> 00:11:49,799
Don't ever come back to Shicheng.

179
00:12:11,000 --> 00:12:11,759
Here! Here!

180
00:12:14,039 --> 00:12:15,799
Come on!

181
00:12:18,600 --> 00:12:19,120
Hurry!

182
00:12:22,360 --> 00:12:23,480
Come on! Quick!

183
00:12:42,080 --> 00:12:43,840
I won't betray Boss Hui.

184
00:13:04,399 --> 00:13:05,919
I'll talk! I'll talk!

185
00:13:07,519 --> 00:13:09,000
What... what do you want to know?

186
00:13:09,960 --> 00:13:10,879
What do you want to know?

187
00:13:19,759 --> 00:13:20,879
Zhong's taken care of, right?

188
00:13:22,120 --> 00:13:22,960
What do you think?

189
00:13:25,399 --> 00:13:25,759
Boss Lin.

190
00:13:26,639 --> 00:13:28,200
This guy refuses to talk.

191
00:13:29,480 --> 00:13:31,360
He thinks we won't dare touch him,
doesn't he?

192
00:13:34,720 --> 00:13:35,320
Fine.

193
00:13:49,720 --> 00:13:50,559
Come save me!

194
00:13:51,720 --> 00:13:52,919
I'm here!

195
00:13:53,639 --> 00:13:55,720
Hurry! Come get me!

196
00:13:55,720 --> 00:13:56,759
Release Hutou Jun!

197
00:13:56,759 --> 00:13:57,720
Hurry! Save me!

198
00:13:57,919 --> 00:13:58,879
Nanhu Gang!

199
00:13:59,960 --> 00:14:01,080
Nanhu Gang is here!

200
00:14:04,399 --> 00:14:05,240
I'm here!

201
00:14:05,559 --> 00:14:06,480
Save me!

202
00:14:06,720 --> 00:14:07,600
Come on!

203
00:14:09,120 --> 00:14:10,200
Boss Jun, I'm here!

204
00:14:10,200 --> 00:14:10,559
Boss Jun!

205
00:14:11,799 --> 00:14:12,679
What took you so long?

206
00:14:12,960 --> 00:14:14,080
You made me suffer all this!

207
00:14:15,159 --> 00:14:16,399
Hurry up!

208
00:14:20,759 --> 00:14:21,360
Are you alright?

209
00:14:21,759 --> 00:14:23,000
What are you? A turtle?

210
00:14:23,600 --> 00:14:24,799
You're Tidao?

211
00:14:25,919 --> 00:14:26,559
Let's go, Boss Jun.

212
00:14:32,279 --> 00:14:33,080
I've never seen you before.

213
00:14:34,080 --> 00:14:34,919
Who do you work for?

214
00:14:35,799 --> 00:14:36,720
I'm talking to you.

215
00:14:43,600 --> 00:14:44,279
Don't run!

216
00:15:02,279 --> 00:15:04,200
Boss Hu, we can't hold them off anymore.

217
00:15:04,440 --> 00:15:05,039
Let's go.

218
00:15:05,039 --> 00:15:05,799
I'm not leaving!

219
00:15:08,080 --> 00:15:08,759
You won't tell us anything,

220
00:15:08,759 --> 00:15:09,320
and you refuse to leave.

221
00:15:09,320 --> 00:15:10,039
What exactly do you want?

222
00:15:10,320 --> 00:15:11,600
They're not here to save me.

223
00:15:11,720 --> 00:15:12,960
They're here to silence me.

224
00:15:13,200 --> 00:15:14,480
I'm not leaving. I'm not going anywhere!

225
00:15:14,759 --> 00:15:15,279
Silence you?

226
00:15:15,639 --> 00:15:16,320
What do you mean?

227
00:15:18,559 --> 00:15:20,600
Boss Lin, we can't hold them
back much longer.

228
00:15:20,759 --> 00:15:21,840
We should hand him over.

229
00:15:22,960 --> 00:15:23,679
Move, move, move!

230
00:15:23,879 --> 00:15:25,240
Just keep me safe,

231
00:15:25,600 --> 00:15:26,600
and I'll tell you the truth.

232
00:15:27,120 --> 00:15:27,799
- Deal.
- Fine.

233
00:15:29,360 --> 00:15:29,679
Talk.

234
00:15:32,679 --> 00:15:33,799
Our Nanhu Gang's territories

235
00:15:34,440 --> 00:15:35,720
are all in the busiest areas.

236
00:15:36,120 --> 00:15:37,399
But we don't have a way
to move our goods.

237
00:15:38,840 --> 00:15:40,120
I've heard this same crap for years.

238
00:15:40,120 --> 00:15:40,879
Nothing new.

239
00:15:40,879 --> 00:15:41,120
Let's go.

240
00:15:41,639 --> 00:15:42,576
Wait, wait! My boss

241
00:15:42,577 --> 00:15:43,279
wanted to work with Boss Hai.

242
00:15:43,399 --> 00:15:44,320
But Boss Hai refused.

243
00:15:44,320 --> 00:15:45,012
So my boss

244
00:15:45,013 --> 00:15:46,120
ordered me to kidnap him.

245
00:15:51,440 --> 00:15:52,039
(Boss Hai)

246
00:15:52,578 --> 00:15:53,399
(Shipping Route Transfer Agreement)

247
00:15:53,399 --> 00:15:54,480
(Why don't you just sign it?)

248
00:15:59,519 --> 00:16:00,759
(That's more like it.)

249
00:16:01,519 --> 00:16:02,600
(Times have changed.)

250
00:16:03,960 --> 00:16:05,879
(A win-win situation is
the only way forward.)

251
00:16:17,240 --> 00:16:18,200
You mean,

252
00:16:18,519 --> 00:16:20,159
Boss Hai gave three shipping routes

253
00:16:20,159 --> 00:16:21,440
to the Nanhu Gang?

254
00:16:21,879 --> 00:16:23,919
When I took Boss Hai to the pier,

255
00:16:24,039 --> 00:16:25,080
he was still alive.

256
00:16:27,080 --> 00:16:28,639
Are you sure Boss Hai was alive?

257
00:16:29,240 --> 00:16:29,600
I...

258
00:16:32,120 --> 00:16:32,759
I'm sure.

259
00:16:33,480 --> 00:16:34,919
He was leaning there at the time.

260
00:16:35,039 --> 00:16:35,960
I didn't hit him that hard.

261
00:16:35,960 --> 00:16:36,799
He should've been fine.

262
00:16:49,159 --> 00:16:50,080
Hutou Jun is over here.

263
00:16:52,120 --> 00:16:52,879
You don't believe me?

264
00:16:53,240 --> 00:16:54,559
No! No! Please!
